  "changes": [
    "Standalone component construction, synchronous calls, concurrent asynchronous calls and disposal use the persistent driver; incoming HTTP keeps its existing path.",
    "Managed invocation records retain saved context, arguments, first errors and uncommitted import returns; native metadata contains identities and indices only.",
    "All native-ready replies are staged before settlement hooks; nested disposal and new admissions preserve their individual results.",
    "Import reply acknowledgement releases its Promise; matching validated ownership receipts release retained aliases.",
    "Idle drivers release their native owner pin; queued collectors retry admission and their retirement cancellation is not a public error.",
    "Current-poll callback errors from any origin precede secondary cleanup failures; native retirement does not duplicate an already delivered rejection."
  ],
